  <item>
    <title>EP12 《色戒》是共同创作？王佳芝的原型竟藏在军统上校的回忆录里？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/640c9a628be5d40013ded25c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">640c9a628be5d40013ded25c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Mar 2023 02:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>值班编辑：尧锋</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【编辑谈】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>春节期间看到了豆瓣上一则关于《色，戒》的讨论，忽然想写一篇文章讨论王佳芝这个人物究竟算不算五四式的青年。为此做了一些功课，文章还没写出来，围绕着《色，戒》的一些考据工作倒是做了不少。这周没人录风凉话，就把这次考据的发现汇总一下做一期播客吧。其实材料都是网上能找到的，主要是做了些汇编。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【目录】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">01:54</a> 难以被定位的张爱玲与难以被评价的《色，戒》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="716">11:56</a> 《色，戒》的前世今生，一个跨越三十年的故事，爱就是不问值得不值得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1266">21:06</a> 戴笠、丁默邨与神秘的朱小姐：《色，戒》原型考据</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【参考资料】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>《谍戒》打字稿：<a data-url="http://www.zonaeuropa.com/culture/c20081005_1.htm" href="http://www.zonaeuropa.com/culture/c20081005_1.htm">www.zonaeuropa.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>《谍戒》中文译本：<a data-url="https://www.douban.com/note/603487039/" href="https://www.douban.com/note/603487039/">www.douban.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>张爱玲与宋淇商量修改《色，戒》的经过两篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="http://www.zonaeuropa.com/culture/c20080302_1.htm" href="http://www.zonaeuropa.com/culture/c20080302_1.htm">www.zonaeuropa.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://m.aisixiang.com/data/34764-2.html" href="https://m.aisixiang.com/data/34764-2.html">m.aisixiang.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/5326151/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/5326151/"><span>一个军统上校的自述</span></a><span>》，关梦龄、李占恒</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【BGM】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Impromptus, Op. 90 D. 899: No. 1 en ut mineur - Alexandre Tharaud</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bagatelles, Op. 126 - No. 2 en sol mineur in G minor g-moll - Alexandre Tharaud</span></p><span></span><p><span>Wong Chia Chi's Theme - Alexandre Desplat</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgKrrWu9I-W0i9ZgJxB_ix7Z7GE1.m4a" length="53856643" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:07</itunes:duration>
