    <pubDate>Wed, 08 Mar 2023 01:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>值班编辑：尧锋 卫明</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【编辑谈】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>四个月没有更新了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这四个月内，大到世界和国家，小到家庭和个人，都经历了一场翻天覆地的变化。三月的第一周，我们聊聊电影市场的动向。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果本期有你感兴趣的内容，或者单纯只是想吐吐槽，都欢迎来评论区玩~</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【目录】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> 重返北京，生活复位，回不去的我们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1051">17:31</a> 拥挤的三月和看不清的市场前景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2237">37:17</a> 并没有变好的好莱坞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3476">57:56</a> 中国商业片与流行文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4429">1:13:49</a> 谍战，中国的专属类型？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【BGM】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Impromptus, Op. 90 D. 899: No. 1 en ut mineur - Alexandre Tharaud</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bagatelles, Op. 126 - No. 2 en sol mineur in G minor g-moll - Alexandre Tharaud</span></p><span></span><p><span>Waitin - Cascadeur</span></p>]]></description>
