  <item>
    <title>EP01 王安忆阻击张爱玲（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/621cc35742107d36fefdfb61</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">621cc35742107d36fefdfb61</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Mar 2022 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>值班编辑：尧锋 戴绣明</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span>【编辑谈】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>本期是关于王安忆改编张爱玲的一次闲谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在大约十一个月前，因为即将上映的《第一炉香》，也因为一次偶然的微信胡侃，张爱玲和她的传奇以及整个伴生的改编世界进入了我们的视野。那时的我们同样以《第一炉香》为范本，创作了一个同骨不同皮的性转故事，由此在之后的十一个月里，我们口中亲切称呼的“张姐”，成为了某种如影随形的陪伴和指导。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她的文章是如此富于文字本身之美，以至于任何照本宣科的改写都显得稍有逊色。我始终觉得，越好的作品总是越难被改编成其他形式的。那么一个小说家对另一个前辈的改编，又会注入怎样的心血呢？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如果本期节目有你感兴趣的话题，欢迎留言讨论。感谢收听。</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span>【目录】</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 王安忆对张爱玲“只是普通读者”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 关于《繁花》的三两事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">05:13</a> 交手的前史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">08:09</a> 剧本对小说的微调</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 典型的“捞男主”做法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">10:28</a> 单一女主还是男女主视角？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 剧本的首尾呼应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 剧本对影像的关照</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="942">15:42</a> 柏油马路大辫子？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="994">16:34</a> 改编需要支点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1054">17:34</a> 堕落需要借口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> 上海作为张爱玲小说中的意象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a> 面对金刚石手镯，电影和小说的不同路径</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1557">25:57</a> 人物逻辑上的替换</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1705">28:25</a> 王张二人的观念分歧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1842">30:42</a> 给司徒协加戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1875">31:15</a> 如何表现妓院式的家庭？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">34:50</a> 改编难以还原张姐本色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2119">35:19</a> 李安的《色戒》太温情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2252">37:32</a> 红白玫瑰最还原</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2287">38:07</a> 张爱玲的电影，选角很重要</span></p><span></span><h2><span>【BGM】</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Impromptus, Op. 90 D. 899: No. 1 en ut mineur - Alexandre Tharaud</span></p><span></span><p><span>The End of Innocence - Alexandre Desplat</span></p>]]></description>
